<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/msa@/~cl_18__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/msa@/~cl_18__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The power to compound any offence under this Ordinance shall be exercised by the Director of Marine personally.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/msa@> .
