<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/msa@/~cl_4__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any ship to which a terminable certificate of registry is granted under the regulations made under this section shall, during the validity of the certificate, be deemed to be a registered Malaysian ship for the purposes of this Ordinance and in relation to all things done or omitted to be done during that period. 58B. Notwithstanding subsection (1) of section 11, the owner of a ship to which a terminable certificate of registry is granted shall fulfill any one of the following conditions:"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/msa@> .
